***** JW: To pass the Sales Document Item Category in custom Field as the standard value is not present in the XML. 23/07/25
billingdocitem_ext_out-yy1_itemcategory_bdi = billingdocitem-salesdocumentitemcategory.

**** JW: To pass the Outbound delivery date in the Invoice Date --- Sales Invoice Form 07/05/2025

"to get the outbound delivery date
SELECT SINGLE *
FROM i_outbounddelivery WITH PRIVILEGED ACCESS
WHERE outbounddelivery = @billingdocitem-referencesddocument
INTO @DATA(ls_outbounddelivery).

IF sy-subrc = 0.
  IF billingdocitem_ext_out-yy1_obdeliverydate_bdi IS INITIAL.
    billingdocitem_ext_out-yy1_obdeliverydate_bdi = ls_outbounddelivery-deliverydate.
  ENDIF.
